(1,'Printer & Scanner','Epson','Photo Default - 10 x 15 cm / 4 x 6 inch: Approx. 92 sec per photo (Borderless) Approx. 69 sec per photo (Border) Draft, A4 (Black / Colour): Up to 33 ppm / 15 ppm ISO 24734, A4 Simplex (Black / Colour): Up to 10.5 ipm / 5.0 ipm ISO 24734, A4 Duplex (Black / Colour): Up to 6.0 ipm / 4.0 ipm First Page Out Time from Ready Mode (Black / Colour): Approx. 10 sec / 16 sec / USB: USB 2.0 Network: Wi-Fi IEEE 802.11b/g/n, Wi-Fi Direct Network Protocol: TCP/IPv4, TCP/IPv6 Network Management Protocols: SNMP, HTTP, DHCP, APIPA, PING, DDNS, mDNS, SLP, WSD, LLTD','uploads/produk/user_manual/1732692158_1731491063-1726032018-invoice-pt-inzan-permata-000003-inv-ags-ip-ix-2024-1.pdf',2,'2024-11-27 00:22:38','2025-05-22 00:29:33','https://e-katalog.lkpp.go.id/','Type : L4260 A4 Wi-Fi Duplex All-In-One Ink Tank Printer\r\nMerek : Epson\r\nNama Alat : EPSON ECOTANK L4260 A4 WI-FI DUPLEX ALL-IN-ONE INK TANK PRINTER\r\nSub - Kategori : Printer\r\nKategori : Komputer & Aksesoris',3000000.00),
(2,'MYBOOK PRO 107 (16S5)','Epson','Notebook Axioo MyBook Pro 107 (16S5) TKDN+BMP 50,70%, Layar 14 inch FHD, Intel Core i7-1065G7, 16GB DDR, 512 GB SSD, Wifi, Bluetooth, windows 10, Garansi 1 Tahun #Gambar produk hanya ilustrasi','uploads/produk/user_manual/1732692273_1731491063-1726032018-invoice-pt-inzan-permata-000003-inv-ags-ip-ix-2024-1.pdf',1,'2024-11-27 00:24:33','2024-11-27 00:24:33','https://e-katalog.lkpp.go.id/','Type : MYBOOK PRO 107 (16S5)\r\nMerek : AXIOO\r\nNama Alat : MYBOOK PRO 107 (16S5)\r\nSub - Kategori : Laptop Dan Monitor\r\nKategori : Komputer & Aksesoris',0.00),
(3,'MYPC ONE PRO J5 (8S2)','Epson','All in one Axioo MyPC One Pro J5 (8S2), TKDN+ BMP 40,01 %, Layar 21.5 inch, Processor Intel core i5-10210U, 8GB Ram, SSD 256GB, Windows 10, Keyboard&Mouse, garansi 1 tahun #foto Produk hanya ilustrasi','uploads/produk/user_manual/1732692360_1731491063-1726032018-invoice-pt-inzan-permata-000003-inv-ags-ip-ix-2024-1.pdf',4,'2024-11-27 00:26:00','2025-05-22 00:41:36','https://e-katalog.lkpp.go.id/','Type : Mypc One Pro J5 (8S2)\r\nMerek : Axioo\r\nNama Alat : MYPC ONE PRO J5 (8S2)\r\nSub - Kategori : P.c\r\nKategori : Komputer & Aksesoris',99999999.00),
(4,'ACER PROJECTOR X1 (3YR ONSITE)','Epson','XGA (1,024x768), 4000 ANSI Lumens, 20.000:1 Dynamic Black, DLP Technology, Aspect ratio 4:3 (Native), 16:9 (Supported), Lamp life 6,000 Hours (Standard), 10,000 Hours (ECO), 15,000 Hours (ExtremeEco), Input port: VGA, HDMI, Composite video (RCA), PC Audio (Stereo mini jack), Output Port: PC Audio (Stereo mini jack), DC Out (5V/1A, USB Type A)','uploads/produk/user_manual/1732692480_1731491063-1726032018-invoice-pt-inzan-permata-000003-inv-ags-ip-ix-2024-1.pdf',4,'2024-11-27 00:28:00','2024-11-27 00:28:00','https://e-katalog.lkpp.go.id/','Type : Projector X1\r\nMerek : ACER\r\nNama Alat : ACER PROJECTOR X1 (3YR ONSITE)\r\nSub - Kategori	: Projektor\r\nKategori: Elektronik',0.00),
(5,'MACBOOK APPLE MACBOOK PRO M2','Epson','NEW APPLE MACBOOK PRO 13\" M2 CHIP 2022 8-Core CPU 10-Core GPU - 2022 Spesifikasi : - 13-inch Retina display with True Tone - Apple M2 chip - 8-Core CPU - 10-Core GPU - 16â€‘core Neural Engine - Memory : 8GB / 16GB - SSD Storage : 256GB / 512GB / 1TB - 13.3-inch (diagonal) LED-backlit display with IPS , 2560x1600 native resolution at 227 - pixels per inch with support for millions of colours - 500 nits brightness - Wide colour (P3) - True Tone technology - Two Thunderbolt / USB 4 ports with support for : * Charging * DisplayPort * Thunderbolt 3 (up to 40 Gbps) * USB 4 (up to 40 Gbps) * USB 3.1 Gen 2 (up to 10 Gbps) - Backlit Magic Keyboard with : * Touch Bar * Touch ID * Ambient light sensor * Force Touch trackpad for precise cursor control and pressureâ€‘sensing capabilities; enables Force clicks, accelerators, pressureâ€‘sensitive drawing and Multiâ€‘Touch gestures include : 13-inch MacBook Pro 67W USB-C Power Adapter USB-C Charge Cable (2m)','uploads/produk/user_manual/1732692586_1731491063-1726032018-invoice-pt-inzan-permata-000003-inv-ags-ip-ix-2024-1.pdf',1,'2024-11-27 00:29:46','2024-11-27 00:29:46','https://e-katalog.lkpp.go.id/','Type : Macbook Pro M2\r\nMerek : Apple\r\nNama Alat : MACBOOK APPLE MACBOOK PRO M2\r\nSub - Kategori	: P.c\r\nKategori : Komputer & Aksesoris',0.00),
